SUMMARY: Olivia Dean in Concert at Toyota Center
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Olivia Dean—multi-BRIT Award\, Mercury Prize\, and Grammy nominee—and her The Art of Loving Live Tour with special guest Baby Rose to Downtown’s arena stage. \nThe tour supports her highly anticipated album\, The Art of Loving.  \nAdmission\nTickets start at $53. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/olivia-dean-in-concert-at-toyota-center/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Date Night,Featured,Nightlife
