SUMMARY:Omar Courtz in Concert at Toyota Center
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes genre-bending star Omar Courtz and his Por Si Mañana No Estoy USA Tour to Downtown’s biggest arena. \nThe tour supports the Puerto Rican singer songwriter’s sophomore album—a streaming hit with music blending R&B\, reggaeton\, Afrobeats\, and trap. \nAdmission \nTickets start at $61. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
