SUMMARY:Classic Albums Live: Led Zeppelin IV at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre welcomes Classic Albums Live back to the Hermann Park stage for a live concert recreating Led Zeppelin IV—an incredible album featuring some of Led Zeppelin’s most beloved and recognizable recordings—note for note and cut for cut under the stars. \nAudiences can sing along with favorites like as “Rock and Roll”\, “When the Levee Breaks”\, and of course\, “Stairway to Heaven”. \nConsidered one of the greatest albums of all time\, Led Zeppelin IV is an album full of experimentation from the way it was recorded to the variety of arrangements. As the best-selling album of one of the best-selling bands\, it sold 37 million+ copies worldwide. \nThis performance was originally scheduled to showcase The Eagles’ Hotel California. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/classic-albums-live-led-zeppelin-iv-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77030\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts Performances,Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Date Night,Featured,Free,History & Culture,Music,Nightlife,Outdoors,Parks
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Classic-Albums-Live-Led-Zeppelin-IV-at-Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
