SUMMARY:Comedian Jay Pharoah at Houston Improv
DESCRIPTION:Houston Improv welcomes comedian\, actor and impressionist Jay Pharoah for 5 stand-up shows over 3 nights. \nBest known for his spot-on impressions\, Pharoah spent six seasons as a cast member on NBC’s Saturday Night Live. \nIn 2017\, he shifted to his first leading role as Floyd Mooney in Showtime’s White Famous\, which was executive produced by Oscar-winner Jaime Foxx and inspired by Foxx’s real-life experiences. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $37. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
