SUMMARY:AC/DC PWR/UP Pop Up at Henke & Pillot
DESCRIPTION:In advance of AC/DC’s live concert at Reliant Stadium on Monday\, August 31\, the free\, official AC/DC PWR/UP Pop Up lands at Henke & Pillot across from Market Square Park in Downtown Houston. \nFans and curious guests can gather\, shop exclusive merchandise\, explore iconic AC/DC props and photo opportunities\, and extend the concert experience around the band’s Houston stop. \nThe first 200 fans through the door will also receive a free commemorative pop-up poster. \nNo concert tickets are required. \n\n\nAdmission\nFree\, including without tickets to the AC/DC concert at Reliant Stadium. Learn more about the AC/DC PWR/UP Pop Up. \n \n\nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/ac-dc-pwr-up-pop-up-at-henke-pillot/2026-08-30/
LOCATION:Henke & Pillot\, 809 Congress Ave\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Drinks & Cocktails,Experiences & Adventures,Featured,Free,History & Culture,Museums,Pop-Ups,Shopping & Retail
