SUMMARY:Performing Arts Houston: Houston Mariachi Festival 2026 at Wortham Center
DESCRIPTION:Performing Arts Houston presents Houston Mariachi Festival 2026—featuring 3 days of original and moving live concert and dance performances—in The Brown Theater at Wortham Center. \nEach individual performance is unique\, featuring different musicians\, performers\, and more. \nHouston Mariachi Festival 2026 Schedule\nTogether\, the 3 weekend performances showcase local rising Houston talents\, world renowned professional mariachi ensembles and dance troupes\, and national champions from the University of Texas Rio Grande Valley. \n\nUniversity of Houston Mariachi Pumas & More | Friday\, August 28 – $35+ 7pm. Get tickets.\nMariachi Imperial de America & More | Saturday\, August 29 – $35+. 7pm. Get tickets.\nUniversity of Texas Rio Grande Valley Mariachi Aztlan & More | Sunday\, August 30 – $35+. 3pm. Get tickets.\n\nAdmission\nTickets start at $35 for each performance. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/performing-arts-houston-houston-mariachi-festival-2026-at-wortham-center-3/
LOCATION:Wortham Theater Center\, 501 Texas St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
