SUMMARY:Jill Scott in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Jill Scott and her To Whom This May Concern Tour\, with special guest Akeem Ali\, for 2 live concerts on the Sugar Land stage. \nA Grammy-winning singer\, songwriter\, and actress\, Jill Scott is known for her soulful blend of R&B\, jazz\, and spoken word. \n\nSince her acclaimed debut Who Is Jill Scott? she’s become a defining voice in contemporary soul\, celebrated for her powerful vocals\, poetic storytelling\, and dynamic live performances. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $101. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/jill-scott-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre-1/
