SUMMARY:Comedian Russell Peters at Houston Improv
DESCRIPTION:Houston Improv welcomes Comedian Russell Peters at Houston Improv for 6 shows over 3 nights on the Spring Branch stage. \nPeters was recently named as one of Rolling Stone’s 50 Best Comics of All Time. \nHe started doing stand-up at the age of 19 at open mics in his native Toronto\, and spent the next 15 years honing his craft at clubs across Canada and the UK. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $68. Order tickets or learn more. \n \n\nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
